{"id":"ce78261af74de716","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-kurtz-martingale.md","title":"Kurtz 随机性的最终有效增长鞅刻画","display":"thm-kurtz-martingale — Kurtz 随机性的最终有效增长鞅刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-kurtz-martingale","aliases":["43-thm-kurtz-martingale"],"display":"thm-kurtz-martingale — Kurtz 随机性的最终有效增长鞅刻画","depends_on":["[[43-df-kurtzrandom]]","[[43-df-computable-martingale]]","[[43-df-computable-order]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§10.5.1 Theorem 10.5.4，印刷234–235，PDF254–255","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-kurtz-martingale"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-kurtz-martingale</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kurtz-martingale — Kurtz 随机性的最终有效增长鞅刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1b1a52dd1295c33c\" href=\"?note=1b1a52dd1295c33c\" title=\"43-df-kurtzrandom\">43-df-kurtzrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4aa7579d0d4e75dc\" href=\"?note=4aa7579d0d4e75dc\" title=\"43-df-computable-martingale\">43-df-computable-martingale</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"57fbcf0c4946d61a\" href=\"?note=57fbcf0c4946d61a\" title=\"43-df-computable-order\">43-df-computable-order</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.5.1 Theorem 10.5.4，印刷234–235，PDF254–255"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1b1a52dd1295c33c\" href=\"?note=1b1a52dd1295c33c\" title=\"43-df-kurtzrandom\">43-df-kurtzrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4aa7579d0d4e75dc\" href=\"?note=4aa7579d0d4e75dc\" title=\"43-df-computable-martingale\">43-df-computable-martingale</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"57fbcf0c4946d61a\" href=\"?note=57fbcf0c4946d61a\" title=\"43-df-computable-order\">43-df-computable-order</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}\\)</span> 是函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，计算性通过统一有理Cauchy近似解释，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4aa7579d0d4e75dc\" href=\"?note=4aa7579d0d4e75dc\" title=\"43-df-computable-martingale\">43-df-computable-martingale</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputableOrder}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComputableOrder}\\)</span> 是函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"57fbcf0c4946d61a\" href=\"?note=57fbcf0c4946d61a\" title=\"43-df-computable-order\">43-df-computable-order</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1b1a52dd1295c33c\" href=\"?note=1b1a52dd1295c33c\" title=\"43-df-kurtzrandom\">43-df-kurtzrandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}(X)\\iff\\neg\\exists d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\exists h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}(d)\\land\\mathrm{ComputableOrder}(h)\\land\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j\\ge N\\}\\;d(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge h(n)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}(X)\\iff\\neg\\exists d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\exists h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}(d)\\land\\mathrm{ComputableOrder}(h)\\land\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j\\ge N\\}\\;d(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge h(n)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Kurtz要求不存在最终持续的有效增长；Schnorr要求不存在无穷多次有效增长；可计算随机性要求不存在任何无界增长。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.5.1 Theorem 10.5.4，印刷234–235，PDF254–255。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-kurtzrandom","status":"resolved","id":"1b1a52dd1295c33c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kurtzrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"4aa7579d0d4e75dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable-martingale]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-order","status":"resolved","id":"57fbcf0c4946d61a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kurtzrandom","status":"resolved","id":"1b1a52dd1295c33c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；定义见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]、[[43-df-computable-martingale]]、[[43-df-computable-order]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"4aa7579d0d4e75dc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；定义见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]、[[43-df-computable-martingale]]、[[43-df-computable-order]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-order","status":"resolved","id":"57fbcf0c4946d61a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；定义见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]、[[43-df-computable-martingale]]、[[43-df-computable-order]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"4aa7579d0d4e75dc","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}$ 是函数 $d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$ 上的布尔谓词，计算性通过统一有理Cauchy近似解释，见 [[43-df-computable-martingale]]。\n$\\mathrm{ComputableOrder}$ 是函数 $h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-computable-order]]。\n$\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-order","status":"resolved","id":"57fbcf0c4946d61a","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}$ 是函数 $d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$ 上的布尔谓词，计算性通过统一有理Cauchy近似解释，见 [[43-df-computable-martingale]]。\n$\\mathrm{ComputableOrder}$ 是函数 $h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-computable-order]]。\n$\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kurtzrandom","status":"resolved","id":"1b1a52dd1295c33c","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}$ 是函数 $d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$ 上的布尔谓词，计算性通过统一有理Cauchy近似解释，见 [[43-df-computable-martingale]]。\n$\\mathrm{ComputableOrder}$ 是函数 $h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-computable-order]]。\n$\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}","display":false},{"tex":"d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComputableOrder}","display":false},{"tex":"h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}(X)\\iff\\neg\\exists d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\exists h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}(d)\\land\\mathrm{ComputableOrder}(h)\\land\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j\\ge N\\}\\;d(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge h(n)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1801,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-208","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-kurtz-martingale]] — Kurtz 随机性的最终有效增长鞅刻画"}],"outgoing":["1b1a52dd1295c33c","4aa7579d0d4e75dc","57fbcf0c4946d61a"]}